# Immersturm Predator: "exile up to one target card from a graveyard and put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." With a target
# chosen that is gone as the ability resolves, the ability does not resolve and none of it happens: no counter (CR 608.2b; the
# ruling of 2024-11-08). The Predator attacks on turn 3 and its trigger targets Bot2's Brainstorm; in response Bot2 exiles that
# Brainstorm itself with Cling to Dust. The Predator stays a 3/3 and deals 3.

